    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστοριόγρᾰφ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>writer of history, historian,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Inscr.Prien.
				37.107
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.62.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.359
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				7.2
			</span></i>, etc.: <i>chronicler</i>, as distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγραφεύς</span> (writer of contemporary
			history), Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.168H.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔφορος ὁ ἱ.</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡρόδοτος ὁ συγγρ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				4.1.6
			</span></i>:—
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστοριαγράφος</span></b> , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἱ. οἱ συγγεγραφότες τὰς Μαγνήτων
					πράξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					560.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				702.3
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				685.93
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>).</div>
